<p>BlastYoBoots- You right, I'm just being stubborn, it was a knee jerk reaction to having my article edited so quickly. But, i stand by it, and I'm going to leave it on my version, although i have being during little edits trying to make it more clinical. You're a good editor (except for the part about the board games, i have to admit that made me twitch. - I was trying not to go into detail about his personality, i mean, among the foundation researchers who cares?) , though, so i am following your version in my changes.</p>
